<title>USA: Blaine, Minn., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Blaine, Minn., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds said it won $2.265 million of Blaine, Minn., general obligation tax increment bonds, Series 1997 B, with a true interest cost of 5.23 percent.</p>
</text>
